## 1. Executive Summary and Purpose

The `L12_Integration_Readiness_Package` serves as a centralized technical archive and consolidation repository for engineering artifacts produced during the Phase 1 software integration cycle of the RudraEdge UAV Flight Platform.

This repository consolidates:

1. High-level system architecture and inter-module topology (M01 through M07).
2. Data interface contracts, serialization specifications, and error-control rules (IF-01 through IF-07).
3. Runtime environment configurations and Software-in-the-Loop (SITL) parameter definitions.
4. Synthetic-data flow automation and telemetry execution logs.
5. Compatibility test reports, defect tracking registers, and requirements traceability matrices.

This document is an index and technical onboarding guide for systems engineers, verification leads, and flight software testers preparing for Stage 2 Hardware-in-the-Loop (HIL) testing.

> **Scope note:** This document summarizes the package and the records described in the source material. Any status stated here should be confirmed against the actual artifacts and test evidence before being treated as independently verified.

