## 8. Defect Register and Resolution Ledger (L11)

The source defect register describes six defects and their reported engineering resolutions.

| Defect ID | Interface | Subsystem | Severity | Root Cause | Engineering Resolution | Retest Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `DEF-UAV-001` | IF-05 | M06 (PSA) | Major | Negative floating-point actuator PWM value cast directly to `uint16` | Added `calculate_pwm_pulse()` with a saturation clamp | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |
| `DEF-UAV-002` | IF-03 | M04 (IAG) | Major | Barometric pressure unit mismatch (`hPa` vs `Pa`) | Ingestion parser multiplies sensor pressure by `100.0` | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |
| `DEF-UAV-003` | IF-04 | M04 (IAG) | Major | 32-bit monotonic timestamp rollover after about 71 minutes | Timestamp structures changed to `uint64_t` microseconds | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |
| `DEF-UAV-004` | IF-02 | M02 (DSC) | Critical | Race condition during multithreaded pre-arm checking | Added atomic bitwise state evaluation with a mutex guard | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |
| `DEF-UAV-005` | IF-06 | M07 (IVR) | Moderate | Ring-buffer overflow during sustained 50 Hz logging | Increased buffer to 64 KB and added an asynchronous background flush worker | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |
| `DEF-UAV-006` | IF-07 | M03 (SDG) | Major | Kinematic velocity vector persisted through an origin reset | Explicitly zeroed acceleration and velocity registers during reset | CLOSED / PASS (reported) |

